<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 22:16:23 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>手机捕捉阳光射线效果</title><link>https://some.pics/6af24633b95cc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的手机对着太阳产生了那种光线效果，大概持续了一秒钟才聚焦，所以我试了大概5次才捕捉到那一瞬间，终于成功了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a large tree with yellow/orange leaves and the sun is peeking through a pine tree" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af24633b95cc.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 22:16:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>收到Chibird新书</title><link>https://some.pics/6af24342a207a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;收到了Chibird的《坏日子不会永远持续》这本书！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small blue hardcover book with cute yellow illustrated birds under a red umbrella, sun and clouds." height="961" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/binarydigit/6af24342a207a.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://binarydigit.some.pics"&gt;@binarydigit&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 22:03:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>无需标签的巫术</title><link>https://some.pics/6af23183a0cae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术不需要标签。如果你喜欢解读卡牌，也喜欢种植草药用于施法，你不必非要选一个能解释这种组合的头衔。你可以追随这些兴趣，而不必先给它们命名。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted storybook witch tending rosemary in a charcoal-framed cliffside greenhouse, with cards on a wooden bench, muted rose floor tiles, and towering amethyst crystals beyond the glass. Ivory serif lettering curves across the stone arch, and a gold botanical emblem sits at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft doesn't need a label. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af23183a0cae.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 20:48:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>精彩但稍晚</title><link>https://some.pics/6af21cc5c6fda</link><description>&lt;p&gt;太棒了，只是有点晚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Groene sloep in een groen kommetje op een bruine tafel" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af21cc5c6fda.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 19:19:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>荷兰庆祝素食豌豆汤</title><link>https://some.pics/6af20359b3a80</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个月后我又有了一个灶台，做素食豌豆汤来庆祝……&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Vuur met pan en iets groens erin" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af20359b3a80.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:31:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥克马尔吉河秋晨薄雾</title><link>https://some.pics/6af1ff99c3c39</link><description>&lt;p&gt;奥克马尔吉河上宁静的秋晨，水面上薄雾袅袅升起，沿岸树木点缀着斑斓秋色。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A peaceful river scene on a clear autumn morning. Large, flat rocks line the foreground along the water's edge, while a thin layer of mist hovers above the calm water. Trees with green, orange, and golden foliage line the opposite bank beneath a bright blue sky." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6af1ff99c3c39.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:15:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>镜子咒语揭示压力下的判断力</title><link>https://some.pics/6af1f588ea089</link><description>&lt;p&gt;压力下揭示自身判断力的镜子咒语
